        {"step": 3, "event_type": "reminder_due", "delay_hours": 75}
      ],
      "email_template_html": "<html><body style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color:#333;\"><p>Hi there,</p><p><strong>Please provide the POD and all lumper receipts (if applicable) combined into one PDF within 48 hours.</strong><br>Images (JPEG, PNG, etc.) are not accepted.</p><p>Also, include <strong>check-in and check-out times</strong> for all stops.<br>As noted in the rate confirmation, <strong>missing documents may result in a rate reduction.</strong></p><p>If already submitted, please disregard.</p><br><p style=\"font-size:13px; color:#666;\"> Kindly note that this email is <strong>not monitored</strong>. Please always make sure to click <strong>“Reply All”</strong> when replying. </p><br><p>Best,<br><strong>T3RA Logistics Team</strong></p><br><div id=\"x_Signature\"><table style=\"color:black;text-align:left;width:435pt;font-size:14px;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;\"><img alt=\"Company Logo\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6074vKi.png\" width=\"80\"></td><td style=\"border-right:1.5pt solid #C2272D;padding:0 10px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><b>Mikey</b></p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#28556A;\">Operations Specialist</p><br><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/t3ra-logistics/posts/?feedView=all\"><img alt=\"LinkedIn\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VFxXRbI.png\" width=\"20\"></a></td><td style=\"padding-left:10px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\">📧 mikey@t3ralogistics.com</p><p style=\"margin:0;\">📞 (916) 458-5833</p><p style=\"margin:0;\">🌐 <a href=\"https://t3ralogistics.com/\">https://t3ralogistics.com/</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></body></html>"
    }
  },
  "driver_assignment": {
    "shadow_mode": false,
    "shadow_emails": {
      "to": ["getrichfunway@gmail.com", "sahil@freightx.ai"]
    },
    "reminders": {
      "steps": [
        {"step": 1, "event_type": "reminder_due", "delay_hours": 48},
        {"step": 2, "event_type": "reminder_due", "delay_hours": 24},
        {"step": 3, "event_type": "reminder_due", "delay_hours": 12},
        {"step": 4, "event_type": "reminder_due", "delay_hours": 6}
      ],
      "email_template_html": "<html><body style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color:#333;\"><p>Hi,</p><p>Kindly requesting you to please provide the driver's tracking details at the earliest to avoid the $100 tracking fee mentioned in the rate confirmation.</p><p>Please note that if we do not receive the driver details at least <strong>3 hours prior to pickup</strong>, we will be forced to recover the load, and in such a case, <strong>TONU will not be applicable.</strong></p><p>Additionally, if you still proceed to pick up the load after we've removed you from it, the <strong>TONU paid to the other carrier will be deducted from your rate confirmation.</strong></p><p>Appreciate your prompt attention to this.</p><br><p style=\"font-size:13px; color:#666;\"> Kindly note that this email is <strong>not monitored</strong>. Please always make sure to click <strong>“Reply All”</strong> when replying. </p><br><p>Best Regards,<br><strong>T3RA Logistics Team</strong></p><br><div id=\"x_Signature\"><table style=\"color:black;text-align:left;width:435pt;font-size:14px;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;\"><img alt=\"Company Logo\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6074vKi.png\" width=\"80\"></td><td style=\"border-right:1.5pt solid #C2272D;padding:0 10px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><b>Mikey</b></p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#28556A;\">Operations Specialist</p><br><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/t3ra-logistics/posts/?feedView=all\"><img alt=\"LinkedIn\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VFxXRbI.png\" width=\"20\"></a></td><td style=\"padding-left:10px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\">📧 mikey@t3ralogistics.com</p><p style=\"margin:0;\">📞 (916) 458-5833</p><p style=\"margin:0;\">🌐 <a href=\"https://t3ralogistics.com/\">https://t3ralogistics.com/</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></body></html>"
    },
    "escalate_driver": {
      "message_title": "Driver details missing — Load {load_id}",
      "message_body": "Carrier {carrier_name} has not responded for load {load_id}.Follow up manually",
      "teams_webhook_url": ""
    }
  }
}
